OL,3,GNEWSADrivers mounting pavements
OL,4,Athreaten bin crew safety
OL,5,
OL,6,FDangerous driving, including motorists
OL,7,Fmounting pavements, is threatening the
OL,8,Fsafety of bin crews, a waste collection
OL,9,Ffirm has said.
OL,11,FOxford Direct Services (ODS), which
OL,12,Fworks on behalf of Oxford City Council,
OL,13,Fsaid it had reported more than a dozen
OL,14,Fincidents of vehicles endangering
OL,15,Fworkers to police.
OL,17,FIt said some of the 15 incidents
OL,18,Fbetween March 2025 and August 2026 had
OL,19,Fresulted in fines and, in some cases,
OL,20,Fbans from driving.
OL,23,APub: 12-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
